==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|physics}} A [[measure]] of the [[ability]] of a body to [[conduct]] [[electricity]]; the [[reciprocal]] of its [[resistance]].

====Related terms====
* {{l|en|conductivity}}
* {{l|en|thermal conductance}}

